# UI components
- Presentation only. Receive data and callbacks by props.
- Never import `@stores/*` (types included), the HTTP client or `axios`. If a
  component needs app data, it is a feature: stop and ask.
- Types a UI component needs live next to it (`types.ts`), not in a store.
- Colors from the theme (`useColors()`), never literal values.
- One folder per component: `Name.tsx`, `index.ts`, styles, and
  `Name.web.tsx` only when web needs different code.
